&lt;p&gt;Come join us for an introduction to 3D printing and CAD! We will learn how to use TinkerCAD and how 3D printing works. There will be a live demonstration of the 3D printer working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free. Ages 8-14. Space is limited, no registration is required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
